msgid "comp7/deserter/cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "comp7/deserter/message"
msgstr "本场战斗尚未结束。如果中途离场，您将令队友失望。\n{brown_open}您的评级点数将被降低，并且将被暂时封禁，无法参加该模式。{brown_close}\n您确定要离开战斗？"

msgid "comp7/deserter/msgTitle"
msgstr "您将失去评级点数！"

msgid "comp7/deserter/submit"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "comp7/deserter/title"
msgstr "中途离场"

msgid "punishmentWindow/message/ban/comp7"
msgstr "您于{whiteSpanish_Open}%(time)s{whiteSpanish_Close}在{whiteSpanish_Open}%(arenaName)s{whiteSpanish_Close}地图上违反了游戏规则。 \n因此，评级点数{whiteSpanish_Open}%(penalty)s{whiteSpanish_Close}，同时，您已被暂时封禁，无法参加{whiteSpanish_Open}天梯战{whiteSpanish_Close}模式战斗。"

msgid "punishmentWindow/message/ban/comp7/qualification"
msgstr "您于{whiteSpanish_Open}%(time)s{whiteSpanish_Close}在{whiteSpanish_Open}%(arenaName)s{whiteSpanish_Close}地图上违反了游戏规则。\n您已被暂时封禁，无法参加{whiteSpanish_Open}天梯战{whiteSpanish_Close}模式战斗，同时，您的评级已降低。"
